Modifications made in this fork (relative to upstream commit d0e4025):
- Base models switched to the Qwen3 family (default Qwen3-1.7B).
- Apple Silicon training through MLX LoRA, with fuse, GGUF conversion and
  serving integrated into the existing training pipeline.
- Factual memory moved to the retrieval layer; L2 training data limited to
  style, preference and value samples; memory add/update/delete without
  retraining; embedding collections isolated per model and endpoint.
- Native chat templates with assistant-only loss; larger inference context
  with a budget for reference memories.
- llama.cpp converter and runtime pinned to the same revision; the vendored
  convert_hf_to_gguf.py was removed in favor of the pinned upstream converter.
- Reliability fixes: embedding batching, LLM timeouts, GraphRAG exit-code
  handling, configurable retrieval threshold, MLX cache limit, graphrag
  package installation.
- An evaluation harness (eval/) comparing this fork with upstream.

See README.md for details and evaluation results.
